Subject: [PATCH] feat(20-06): enforce closed runtime policy decisions

Add fresh task, agent, dispatch, ownership, and telemetry decisions.

Persist a local max_active_agents cap and reject new sessions without eviction.

Keep vault, ownership, confirmation, and supervision boundaries locked.
